.SH NAME
QBitVal \- Internal class, used with QBitArray
\fBClasses\fR - Annotated - Tree - Functions - Home - \fBStructure\fR </div>
.br
.SH SYNOPSIS
.br
.PP
\fC#include <qbitarray.h>\fR
.PP
.SS "Public Members"
.in +1c
